# <%- name %>

<%- description || 'Runs the existing image `' + image + '` in the hub.' %>

- Image: `<%- image %>`, HTTP port <%- port %>, health check `GET <%- healthPath %>`.
- Persistent data: the `data` volume in `compose.yaml` — point it at the path the image writes to.
- Validate: `pnpm nx run <%- id %>:validate`. If health fails, check the image listens on `0.0.0.0:<%- port %>` and that `<%- healthPath %>` answers 2xx (a redirect to a login page is not 2xx; pick another path).

See `docs/adding-an-app.md`.
